bocl> (compile-file "~/src/lisp/encours/symbol-sxhash.lisp" "~/src/lisp/encours/symbol-sxhash.fas")  

#<PHYSICAL-PATHNAME 0x47e579e30>

print, prin1 of physical pathnames should print out the the readable
form of the pathname, and princ should write the namestring:

eg.
cl-user> (princ #P"/Users/pjb/notes.txt")
/Users/pjb/notes.txt          ; princ output
#P"/Users/pjb/notes.txt"      ; print output
